  "description": "🍂 A beautiful collection of cozy autumn watercolor clipart featuring warm seasonal décor, comforting autumn treats, woodland animals, botanical elements, cozy clothing, and charming fall lifestyle illustrations. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with rich autumn tones, smooth painterly gradients, and elegant simplified details, this collection captures the warmth, comfort, and beauty of the fall season.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Packaging and branding projects\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Autumn and Thanksgiving designs\n• Seasonal home décor projects\n🤍 What’s included:\n– 24 high-quality illustrations\n– White background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 24 PNG files\n– 24 SVG files\n🍂 Included illustrations:\nhot chocolate mug, knitted sweater on wooden hanger, rubber rain boots with autumn leaves, woven autumn basket, autumn market stand, vintage book wrapped in a blanket, cinnamon rolls, pumpkin spice candle, ceramic teapot with autumn tea, velvet pumpkin, autumn leaf wreath, apple butter jar with toast, vintage lantern, hedgehog with scarf, reading fox, squirrel holding a pine cone, oak branch with acorns, rowan berry branch, decorative pumpkin collection, woven scarf, apple pie, knitted hat and mittens, dried flower bouquet in ceramic vase, vintage autumn window etc.\n✨ Inspired by crisp autumn mornings, pumpkin patches, cozy cafés, seasonal baking, woodland walks, rustic home décor, bookish afternoons, warm blankets, autumn markets, and the comforting atmosphere of fall. These illustrations are perfect for creating elegant, cozy, and timeless autumn-themed designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🍂 A beautiful collection of cozy autumn watercolor clipart featuring warm seasonal décor, comforting autumn treats, woodland animals, botanical elements, cozy clothing, and charming fall lifestyle illustrations. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with rich autumn tones, smooth painterly gradients, and elegant simplified details, this collection captures the warmth, comfort, and beauty of the fall season.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and invitations<br>\n• Packaging and branding projects<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Autumn and Thanksgiving designs<br>\n• Seasonal home décor projects</p>\n<p>🤍 What’s included:<br>\n– 24 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– White background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 24 PNG files<br>\n– 24 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍂 Included illustrations:<br>\nhot chocolate mug, knitted sweater on wooden hanger, rubber rain boots with autumn leaves, woven autumn basket, autumn market stand, vintage book wrapped in a blanket, cinnamon rolls, pumpkin spice candle, ceramic teapot with autumn tea, velvet pumpkin, autumn leaf wreath, apple butter jar with toast, vintage lantern, hedgehog with scarf, reading fox, squirrel holding a pine cone, oak branch with acorns, rowan berry branch, decorative pumpkin collection, woven scarf, apple pie, knitted hat and mittens, dried flower bouquet in ceramic vase, vintage autumn window etc.</p>\n<p>✨ Inspired by crisp autumn mornings, pumpkin patches, cozy cafés, seasonal baking, woodland walks, rustic home décor, bookish afternoons, warm blankets, autumn markets, and the comforting atmosphere of fall. These illustrations are perfect for creating elegant, cozy, and timeless autumn-themed designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.</p>",
